here","Runs the Claude Code binary and tool loop inside a process you operate, with Python or TypeScript APIs for permissions, sessions, hooks, and MCP. It can support game-specific repair and validation services, but domain tools, scoring rules, and runtime environments must be supplied. This differs from a Client SDK for direct model calls; the official overview also specifies Anthropic Commercial Terms and separate authentication constraints.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Framework","Category","Coding agents","category","lead","summary","name","agents","framework",[85,86,87,88,89],[114,115,116],[111,112,113],"2d","3d","world","plan","code","test",{"_118":119},"documents",{"_120":121,"_122":123},"en",[125,129,130,131,128,132,133,134,135,136,137,138,139,140,141,142,143,144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153,154,155,156,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,127,164,126,165,166,167,168,169,170,171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,183,184,185],"zh",[124,125,126,127,128],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","contributing","media-sources","icon-sources","content-model","skills/level-design/SKILL","skills/level-design/LICENSE","design/de